  "scope": "The unchanged assistant-recipe source passes complete 210-check unpacked and actual installed desktop suites, including four recipe checks with zero model requests. Eight exact unpacked records are preserved before the installed suite overwrites common records. Five current installed recipe captures are individually reviewed. Four settings checks, seven portable checks with two real long-path launches, original bootstrap input inventories, actual current-user Unicode-path installation, shortcuts and data-retaining uninstall all pass. All ten required records satisfy current strict matching-body policy, and all four actual distributable hashes match those records. Earlier cropped/incomplete UI captures remain negative source evidence. Complete hosted acceptance, remaining capability/UI/physical work and publication remain pending.",
